  - 段落 2（较小 `text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl`）：「A platform where content, community, and insight flow together — with less noise, less friction, and more meaning for everyone involved.」
  - 带项目符号的标签行：`Depth`、`Reach`、`Meaning`（全大写字间距 3px，低调色）。

## 版块 5 —— Solution（粘性 12 列网格）

- `py-32 md:py-44 border-t border-border/30 px-6 md:px-8`。
