    - Resources：Writer Guide、Reader FAQ、Press Kit、Brand
    - Company：About、Careers、Contact、Journal
- 底部栏 `pt-8 flex md:flex-row items-center justify-between`：左侧「© 2026 Mindloop. All rights reserved.」；右侧 Privacy / Terms / Cookies。
